---
import SectionTitle from '../ui/SectionTitle.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 bg-[#F8F8F8] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <SectionTitle
        eyebrow="Nuestros Clientes"
        title="Confianza de la <span class='text-[#C41230]'>industria boliviana</span>"
        subtitle="Empresas líderes del sector industrial confían en la calidad y confiabilidad de nuestros minerales."
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Client logos grid -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8">
      {Array.from({ length: 8 }).map((_, i) => (
        <div class="w-32 h-16 bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 hover:border-[#C41230]/30 hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center group">
          <div class="text-[#4A5568]/30 group-hover:text-[#4A5568]/60 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase transition-colors">
            Cliente {i + 1}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonial -->
    <div class="mt-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 bg-[#C41230] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[#4A5568] text-lg leading-relaxed italic mb-6 mt-2">
          "La calidad constante de los minerales y la puntualidad en las entregas de Minera La Cordillera del Sur han sido fundamentales para la continuidad de nuestros procesos industriales."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#C41230] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
            GM
          </div>
          <div class="text-left">
            <div class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] text-sm">Gerente de Operaciones</div>
            <div class="text-[#718096] text-xs">Empresa Industrial Boliviana</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
